      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُدْحَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A ladleful</i> of broth: (S, L, K:) and
some say that ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدْحَةٌ</span></b>  signifies the same. (L.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْطِنِى قُدْحَةً مِنْ مَرَقَتِكَ</span> <i>Give thou to
me a ladleful of thy broth.</i> (S.)

